    <briefdescription>
<para>Allow printing <ref refid="classllvm_1_1json_1_1_value" kindref="compound">json::Value</ref> with <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a653cce37b80c03eebe7a00520a8eabb6" kindref="member">formatv()</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The default style is basic/compact formatting, like operator&lt;&lt;. A format string like formatv(&quot;{0:2}&quot;, <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value" kindref="compound">Value</ref>) pretty-prints with indent 2. </para>
